"featured":0,"headline":"Khusnutdinov signs three-year, $11.85 million contract with Bruins","summary":"Marat Khusnutdinov signed a three-year, $11.85 million contract with the Boston Bruins on Wednesday. It begins next season and has an average annual value of $3.95 million.","parts":[{"type":"photo","_translationId":"e71ee7a5-b1d4-4ac0-a987-89163ace0bd8","_entityId":"4c21d12e-1651-41e5-8d21-366bf3b4a32d","selfUrl":"https://forge-dapi.d3.nhle.com/v2/content/en-us/photos/khusnutdinov-bos-contract","title":"Khusnutdinov BOS contract","slug":"khusnutdinov-bos-contract","featured":0,"createdBy":"Antonio Graziuso","lastUpdatedBy":"Antonio Graziuso","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-10-20T16:36:15.702Z","contentDate":"2026-10-20T16:35:23.121Z","image":{"title":"Khusnutdinov BOS contract","templateUrl":"https://media.d3.nhle.com/image/private/{formatInstructions}/v1792514157/prd/cjmp7vln5leadcw3aw7j","thumbnailUrl":"https://media.d3.nhle.com/image/private/t_ratio1_1-size20/v1792514157/prd/cjmp7vln5leadcw3aw7j","format":"jpg","overriddenFormats":{}},"fields":{"altText":"Marat Khusnutdinov #92 of the Boston Bruins skates against the Ottawa Senators on October 5, 2026, at the TD Garden in Boston, Massachusetts.","credit":"Steve Babineau/NHLI via Getty Images"},"contextualFields":{},"tags":[]},{"type":"markdown","content":"<forge-entity title=\"Marat Khusnutdinov\" slug=\"marat-khusnutdinov-8482177\" code=\"player\">Marat Khusnutdinov</forge-entity> signed a three-year, $11.85 million contract with the Boston Bruins on Wednesday. It begins next season and has an average annual value of $3.95 million.","contextualFields":{}},{"type":"external","externalType":"story-part-ad","content":{"culture":"en-us","content":{"adSize":"300x250","position":20,"slotId":""}},"contextualFields":{}},{"type":"markdown","content":"The 24-year-old forward is in the final season of a two-year, $1.85 million contract ($925,000 AAV) he signed with Boston on June 29, 2025. He could have become a restricted free agent on July 1, 2027.\n\nKhusnutdinov has five points (two goals, three assists) in 10 games this season. He had career highs in goals (15), assists (18) and points (33) in 77 games with Boston in 2025-26.\n\nSelected by the Minnesota Wild in the second round (No. 37) of the 2020 NHL Draft, Khusnutdinov has 54 points (23 goals, 31 assists) in 178 regular-season game for the Wild and Bruins and no points in six Stanley Cup Playoff games.\n\nThe Bruins (7-2-1), who have a six-game point streak (5-0-1), host the Nashville Predators on Thursday (7 p.m. ET; SCRIPPS, NESN).","contextualFields":{}},{"type":"customentity","_translationId":"95c71298-e3b5-43b8-b78c-7b9b2a47640f","_entityId":"60b2327e-7d03-4d17-8a86-38cc291e0233","selfUrl":"https://forge-dapi.d3.nhle.com/v2/content/en-us/promos/nhl-app-promotion","title":"NHL App promotion","slug":"nhl-app-promotion","thumbnail":{"title":"nhl-app-17.0-2568x1444","templateUrl":"https://media.d3.nhle.com/image/private/{formatInstructions}/prd/yh25zejclzi5kdany34a","thumbnailUrl":"https://media.d3.nhle.com/image/private/t_ratio1_1-size20/prd/yh25zejclzi5kdany34a","format":"png","overriddenFormats":{},"slug":"nhl-app-17-0-2568x1444","selfUrl":"https://forge-dapi.d3.nhle.com/v2/content/en-us/photos/nhl-app-17-0-2568x1444"},"entityCode":"promo","fields":{"headline":"The NHL App is Your Home for Hockey","url":{"url":"https://www.nhl.com/fans/nhl-app-16.0","openInNewTab":false},"description":"Dive in with new **Player Pages** and **Stats** experiences that incorporate **EDGE** Advanced Stats; **\"How to Watch\"** to help navigate your tune-in choices; **Live Activities/Live Updates** to set-and-forget for as many teams as you want, plus a whole lot more.","callToAction1Link":{"displayText":"What's New in NHL App?","url":"https://www.nhl.com/fans/nhl-app-16.0","openInNewTab":false},"backgroundImage":"asset_1b414c4e-6853-4cc9-abf1-2e38644e5994"},"contextualFields":{"layout":"horizontal with image left"},"tags":[{"_translationId":"8ba4